  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/15/custom-background-hd.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"78\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">概述</span></p><p>专为我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>整合包定制的主菜单背景资源包，现已独立发布。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">功能说明</span></p><p>本资源包可自由替换主菜单背景图，为原版游戏体验增色。</p><p>只需下载并加载此资源包，即可享受个性化主菜单背景。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>背景替换指南：</p><p>- 准备任意PNG格式截图或高清图片，覆盖压缩包内以下路径文件：<em>Custom Background HD.zip/assets/minecraft/textures/gui/title/background/<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">panorama_overlay.png</span></em></p><p>- 确保将背景图重命名为'panorama_overlay.png'</p><p>- 加载资源包后即可生效</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>默认背景图源：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fillustrations%252ffire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/illustrations/fire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583/</a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/12/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/13/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/14/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即搭建服务器与好友联机！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
